    "title": "Basketball Recap: Pinon Comes Up Short - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n18 hours ago Pinon was not able to break out of their rough patch on Tuesday as the team picked up their third straight defeat. They took an 80-66 bruising from the Northland Prep Academy Spartans. While losing is never fun, the Eagles can't take it too hard given the team's big disadvantage in MaxPreps' Arizona basketball rankings (they are ranked 226th, while the Spartans are ranked 82nd). Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
